  "description": "Pure-managed HEIF / HEIC decoder for .NET: ISOBMFF container (ISO/IEC 14496-12),\nHEIF item model (ISO/IEC 23008-12), and HEVC intra decode (ITU-T H.265 Main and Main 10 profiles).\nDecodes tiled still images (grid), 8-bit and 10-bit, with ICC colour profiles, nclx colour signalling and the\nclap / irot / imir transforms. NOT included in the Sdcb.SimdCodecs meta-package; consumers install it and\nregister it with the facade explicitly: ImageCodecs.Register(HeifImageDecoder.Registration).\nNOTE: HEVC (H.265) is patent-encumbered. This package conveys no patent licence. Users are\nresponsible for evaluating HEVC patent obligations in their jurisdiction.",
